&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #a18cd1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Kind Of Christmas:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #1e90ff&quot;&gt;In all instances where the SCP object has been capable of speech, the effector of the breach was described as “a kind man.”&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #a18cd1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;From Unknown Admirer to Unknown Admiree:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #1e90ff&quot;&gt;Even if it&#039;s the kindest of men.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #a18cd1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;#8230;Like Clockwork:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #1e90ff&quot;&gt;（其实我看了一遍原文但还是不敢确定）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #a18cd1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reap What You Sew:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #1e90ff&quot;&gt;On the card, in a neat, blue, cursive script&amp;#8230;The last thing Kairos saw before the lid shut and he was sent off to places unknown, was a loving smile, and a pair of kind eyes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #a18cd1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-1252:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #1e90ff&quot;&gt;The letter had no return address and the message contained details of Suzie&#039;s condition written in neat blue ink. （蓝色墨水的neat，不过其实不加也可以？）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #a18cd1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-1353:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #1e90ff&quot;&gt;I just woke up thinking about some man with kind eyes I saw down the street the day before, how he touched my arm and said he was sorry before walking off.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #a18cd1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-1551:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #1e90ff&quot;&gt;Especially that man snooping around, the one with the kind smile.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #a18cd1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-166:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #1e90ff&quot;&gt;（&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;我暂时没找着，&lt;/span&gt;不过我喜欢这个故事（。）我找到了！谁能想到会有空白折叠页这种操作啊！&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #a18cd1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-1771:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #1e90ff&quot;&gt;Upon routine inspection of SCP-1771-03 during fall season, Agent ██ reported finding a letter directed to a non-existent inhabitant referred to only as &#039;the kind man who did the redecorating&#039;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #a18cd1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-2331:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #1e90ff&quot;&gt;I did something very kind for him once. We&#039;ve had a kind of friendship ever since.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #a18cd1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-2353:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #1e90ff&quot;&gt;Even that kind, poor fella cashiering the damn place was giving you a side-eye!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #a18cd1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-2442:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #1e90ff&quot;&gt;You&#039;re kinder than the description frames you, you know.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #a18cd1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-2552:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #1e90ff&quot;&gt;I AM NO K[illegible].&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #a18cd1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-2662:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #1e90ff&quot;&gt;Welcome Researcher K███ M██&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #a18cd1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-2772:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #1e90ff&quot;&gt;On the card was a note written with blue ink in neat cursive containing what is believed to be the entire decoded transcript of Auditory Event 482&amp;#8230;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #a18cd1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-2882:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #1e90ff&quot;&gt;&#039;When Kindness Is Eclipsed With Cruelty&#039;（大概是）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #a18cd1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-2909:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #1e90ff&quot;&gt;One kind man had put a gun to me.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #a18cd1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-2992:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #1e90ff&quot;&gt;Doctor K. M██(primary)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #a18cd1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-414:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #1e90ff&quot;&gt;Routine interviews will be conducted by Dr. K███ M██.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #a18cd1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5699:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #1e90ff&quot;&gt;And even if, you would have still shown me kindness.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #a18cd1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5995:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #1e90ff&quot;&gt;（别问，问就是没找着（。（我看了&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;一&lt;/span&gt;两遍原文&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;两&lt;/span&gt;三遍译文，&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;不过都没有特别仔细，就先这样吧&lt;/span&gt;只发现了Agent Kevin McHannon（化名Keith McKinsey）和Kair Malone博士，但我觉得证据不足？？？&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #a18cd1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-747:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #1e90ff&quot;&gt;Blue crayon written in neat cursive.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #a18cd1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-797:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #1e90ff&quot;&gt;Dr.K███M██&#039;s note（第二张图每次都把我吓一跳）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #a18cd1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-979:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #1e90ff&quot;&gt;SCP-979 was featured in an exhibition by an artist under the pseudonym of The Kind Man, in the ████████ Museum.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #a18cd1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Seasick Sharks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #1e90ff&quot;&gt;Even the strangers, that kind man who looked to me in pity as if he could know my sacrifice.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #a18cd1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Melody Of Autumn, Passing Into Winter:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #1e90ff&quot;&gt;the scarecrow and his kind friend had their discussion&amp;#8230; His friend was there, sitting in the fog, exhaling a familiar purple smoke.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #a18cd1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Slow Asphyxiation Of Undiluted Ardor:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #1e90ff&quot;&gt;Once, a Kinder person arrived in the lizard&#039;s room of love.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #a18cd1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Special Bond Between Child and Mother:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #1e90ff&quot;&gt;even if it is to deliver to a world without Kind Men&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #a18cd1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;They Who Find Darkness Loving:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: white&quot;&gt;In that dream a man leans against a white hallway, puffing on a cigarette that produces purple smoke.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #a18cd1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This Is How We Build Revelation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #1e90ff&quot;&gt;The bus driver announced no stops on her way home, kindly silent, and allowed her the space to ponder the difference between migration and abandonment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
